Which tag should you use for a standalone piece of content (like a blog post) instead of a <div>
A)<aside>
B)<article>  //answers
C)<nav>
D)<form>


✅ Correct Answer: B. <article>

Explanation (Simple)

The <article> tag is used for standalone, self-contained content, such as:

📝 Blog posts
📰 News articles
💬 Forum posts
⭐ User comments

It gives semantic meaning, helping browsers, search engines, and screen readers understand the content.

Example:

<article>
  <h2>My First Blog Post</h2>
  <p>Welcome to my blog!</p>
</article>
Why not the others?
A. <aside> → For side content (e.g., sidebar, related links).
B. <article> → ✅ Correct! Standalone content.
C. <nav> → For navigation links.
D. <form> → For user input forms.

✅ Correct Answer: B. <article>


